    "clips": [
      {
        "id": "C0001",
        "start": 0.3,
        "end": 3.875,
        "text": "You type, “Why is the sky blue?” and press send."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0002",
        "start": 3.955,
        "end": 6.93,
        "text": "What happens before the answer appears?"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0003",
        "start": 7.01,
        "end": 11.11,
        "text": "Let’s follow a text-generating AI, step by step."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0004",
        "start": 12.8,
        "end": 15.9,
        "text": "First, the app prepares the model’s input."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0005",
        "start": 15.98,
        "end": 19.83,
        "text": "That can include your message, earlier chat messages,"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0006",
        "start": 19.91,
        "end": 23.985,
        "text": "and instructions about how the assistant should respond."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0007",
        "start": 24.065,
        "end": 27.19,
        "text": "The exact package varies between apps."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0008",
        "start": 28.3,
        "end": 33.35,
        "text": "Next, a tokenizer turns the text into small pieces called tokens."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0009",
        "start": 33.43,
        "end": 35.705,
        "text": "A token can be a word,"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0010",
        "start": 35.785,
        "end": 38.485,
        "text": "part of a word, or punctuation."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0011",
        "start": 38.565,
        "end": 42.74,
        "text": "Each piece gets a numeric ID the model can process."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0012",
        "start": 44.3,
        "end": 48.375,
        "text": "Those IDs become lists of numbers, called vectors."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0013",
        "start": 48.455,
        "end": 51.905,
        "text": "The model also tracks the order of the tokens."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0014",
        "start": 51.985,
        "end": 56.235,
        "text": "Transformer layers use attention to mix information"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0015",
        "start": 56.315,
        "end": 58.94,
        "text": "from the context available to it."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0016",
        "start": 59.02,
        "end": 61.645,
        "text": "Other layers transform it further."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0017",
        "start": 61.725,
        "end": 66.15,
        "text": "This is computation using patterns learned during training."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0018",
        "start": 67.3,
        "end": 70.375,
        "text": "The model scores possible next tokens."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0019",
        "start": 70.455,
        "end": 74.68,
        "text": "A decoding rule chooses one, sometimes by sampling."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0020",
        "start": 74.76,
        "end": 77.685,
        "text": "Then the new token joins the context,"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0021",
        "start": 77.765,
        "end": 79.965,
        "text": "and the process repeats."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0022",
        "start": 80.045,
        "end": 84.245,
        "text": "“The sky looks blue because…” grows one piece at a time,"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0023",
        "start": 84.325,
        "end": 87.5,
        "text": "until a stop condition ends the response."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0024",
        "start": 88.3,
        "end": 92.475,
        "text": "If the app provides tools, the model may request a search."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0025",
        "start": 92.555,
        "end": 95.78,
        "text": "The app runs it and returns the result."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0026",
        "start": 95.86,
        "end": 98.21,
        "text": "That is an optional extra,"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0027",
        "start": 98.29,
        "end": 100.64,
        "text": "not part of every answer."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0028",
        "start": 102.3,
        "end": 106.925,
        "text": "So the journey is context, tokens, and model computation,"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0029",
        "start": 107.005,
        "end": 111.08,
        "text": "followed by repeated prediction to build the response."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0030",
        "start": 111.16,
        "end": 114.61,
        "text": "A normal prompt guides an already-trained model;"
      },
      {
        "id": "C0031",
        "start": 114.69,
        "end": 117.065,
        "text": "it doesn’t retrain its weights."
      },
      {
        "id": "C0032",
        "start": 117.145,
        "end": 121.245,
        "text": "And a fluent answer still needs checking when the facts matter."
      }
    ],
